          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:85f5ccd11603e44c12a8d581a1a15fc5388c73ca3e8d8e307d0ed68e02c3ca68:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_aeffab96809941afb5192c6568ea52d0",
      "statement": "The SourceChunk chunk-rebase contract holds for the LlamaIndex chunk adapter: after the pipeline adds base_doc_offset to the alignment result, source.text[citation.char_start:citation.char_end] == citation.evidence is satisfied even without document_text, because the alignment pipeline's slice helper falls back to chunk-local slicing when the parent text is not supplied.",
